  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "(A) Mass density $=\\frac{M}{V}=M^1 L^{-3}$...(iv)<br/>(B) Impulse $=\\mathrm{M} \\times \\mathrm{u}=\\mathrm{M}^1 \\mathrm{~L}^1 \\mathrm{~T}^{-1}$....(ii)<br/>(C) Power $=\\mathrm{F}. \\mathrm{V}=\\mathrm{M}^1 \\mathrm{~L}^2 \\mathrm{~T}^{-3}$....(i)<br/>(D) Moment of inertia $=\\mathrm{Mr}^2=\\mathrm{M}^1 \\mathrm{~L}^2$...(iii)",
